ight: 0px; display: inline; flex-direction: row; position: static; opacity: 1\\">\\n\\t\\t\\tМы используем файлы cookies. Продолжая работать с сайтом, Вы соглашаетесь\\n\\t\\t\\tс использованием файлов cookies и на обработку персональных данных в соответствии\\n\\t\\t\\tс <a href=\\"#\\" class=\\"cookie-link\\" style=\\"color: rgb(66, 71, 77); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 17.028px; text-align: start; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(66, 71, 77); border-radius: 0px; width: 989px; height: 34.0625px; display: block; flex-direction: row; position: static; opacity: 1\\">Положением об обработке персональных данных</a>.\\n\\t\\t</p>\\n\\t\\t<button id=\\"cookieAccept\\" class=\\"cookie-button\\" style=\\"color: rgb(66, 71, 77); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13.2px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 17.028px; text-align: start; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(66, 71, 77); border-radius: 0px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: inline; flex-direction: row; position: static; opacity: 1\\">Согласен</button>\\n\\t</div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<div class=\\"modal fade modal-history\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" tabindex=\\"-1\\" id=\\"modal-history\\" style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 26px; text-align: start; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(33, 37, 41); border-radius: 0px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; flex-direction: row; position: static; opacity: 1\\">\\n\\t<div class=\\"modal-dialog modal-lg modal-dialog-centered\\" style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 26px; text-align: start; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(33, 37, 41); border-radius: 0px; width: 100%; min-width: 0px; height: 100%; min-height: 0px; flex-direction: row; position: fixed; top: 0px; left: 0px; z-index: 1060; opacity: 0\\">\\n\\t\\t<div class=\\"modal-content\\" style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 26px; text-align: start; padding: 0px; margin: 26.25px auto; border: 0px none rgb(33, 37, 41); border-radius: 0px; max-width: 856px; min-width: 0px; min-height: calc(100% - 52.5px); display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center; position: relative; opacity: 1\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<button class=\\"btn-close\\" type=\\"button\\" data-bs-dismiss=\\"modal\\" aria-label=\\"Закрыть модальное окно\\" style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-image: url(&quot;https://www.fitnesshouse.ru/assets/templates/fh2023/img/modal/girl-swimming-pool.jpg&quot;); background: rgb(255, 255, 255) url(&quot;https://www.fitnesshouse.ru/assets/templates/fh2023/img/modal/girl-swimming-pool.jpg&quot;) no-repeat scroll 0px 100% / 100% 220px padding-box padding-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 26px; text-align: start; padding: 0px 0px 220px; margin: 0px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); border-radius: 22px; width: 100%; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; position: relative; opacity: 1\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<svg class=\\"icon\\" width=\\"26\\" height=\\"26\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<use xlink:href=\\"/assets/templates/fh2023/img/sprite.svg#btn-close\\"></use>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t</svg>\\n\\t\\t\\t</button>\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\"modal-body\\" style=\\"color: rgb(66, 71, 77); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 26px; text-align: center; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(66, 71, 77); border-radius: 0px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: inline; flex-direction: row; position: static; opacity: 1\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<section class=\\"history\\" style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 26px; text-align: start; padding: 32px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(33, 37, 41); border-radius: 0px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: block; flex-direction: row; position: relative; opacity: 1\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\"history__header\\" style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 26px; text-align: start; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(33, 37, 41); border-radius: 0px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: block; flex-direction: row; position: static; opacity: 1\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<h3 class=\\"title\\" style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 26px; text-align: start; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(33, 37, 41); border-radius: 0px; width: 100%; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: baseline; position: static; opacity: 1\\">История компании</h3>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<svg class=\\"icon\\" width=\\"130\\" height=\\"22\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 130 22\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<use xlink:href=\\"/assets/templates/fh2023/img/sprite.svg#logo\\"></use>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</svg>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<ul class=\\"history__list\\" style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 26px; text-align: start; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(33, 37, 41); border-radius: 0px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: block; flex-direction: row; position: static; opacity: 1\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li class=\\"history__item\\" style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 26px; text-align: start; padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(33, 37, 41); border-radius: 0px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; position: relative; opacity: 1\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<time datetime=\\"2007\\" class=\\"history__title\\" style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 26px; text-align: start; padding: 0px 0px 16px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(33, 37, 41); border-radius: 0px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: start; position: static; opacity: 1\\">2007 год</time>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\"history__text\\" role=\\"article\\" style=\\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(94, 135, 159); background: rgb(94, 135, 159) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 27px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 32.4px; text-align: start; padding: 5px 15px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(255, 255, 255); border-radius: 30px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: block; flex-direction: row; position: relative; opacity: 1\\">30&nbsp;июня 2007&nbsp;г. открывается первый Fitness House на&nbsp;Стрелке Васильевского острова, в&nbsp;самом центре Санкт-Петербурга.</div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li class=\\"history__item\\" style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 20.8px; text-align: start; padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(0, 0, 0); border-radius: 0px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: block; flex-direction: row; position: static; opacity: 1\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<time datetime=\\"2011\\" class=\\"history__title\\" style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 26px; text-align: start; padding: 0px 0px 16px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(33, 37, 41); border-radius: 0px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: start; position: static; opacity: 1\\">2011 год</time>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\"history__text\\" role=\\"article\\" style=\\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(94, 135, 159); background: rgb(94, 135, 159) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 27px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 32.4px; text-align: start; padding: 5px 15px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(255, 255, 255); border-radius: 30px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: block; flex-direction: row; position: relative; opacity: 1\\">Этот год ознаменовался для Fitness House стремительным ростом и всесторонним развитием. И к началу 2011 г сеть насчитывала уже 26 просторных клубов в разных районах Санкт Петербурга.</div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li class=\\"history__item\\" style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 20.8px; text-align: start; padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(0, 0, 0); border-radius: 0px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: block; flex-direction: row; position: static; opacity: 1\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<time datetime=\\"2017\\" class=\\"history__title\\" style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 26px; text-align: start; padding: 0px 0px 16px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(33, 37, 41); border-radius: 0px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: start; position: static; opacity: 1\\">2017 год</time>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\"history__text\\" role=\\"article\\" style=\\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(80, 149, 172); background: rgb(80, 149, 172) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 27px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 32.4px; text-align: start; padding: 5px 15px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(255, 255, 255); border-radius: 30px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: block; flex-direction: row; position: relative; opacity: 1\\">В начале 2017&nbsp;г. сеть насчитывает 43 клуба, из&nbsp;них&nbsp;— 34 клуба с&nbsp;бассейными комплексами,\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t5 клубов без бассейнов, 4 клуба премиум класса Fitness House.\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tВ&nbsp;этом году Fitness House начинает покорять регионы. Осенью открываются первые клубы в&nbsp;Нижнем Новгороде и&nbsp;Казани.</div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li class=\\"history__item\\" style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 20.8px; text-align: start; padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(0, 0, 0); border-radius: 0px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: block; flex-direction: row; position: static; opacity: 1\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<time datetime=\\"2018\\" class=\\"history__title\\" style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 26px; text-align: start; padding: 0px 0px 16px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(33, 37, 41); border-radius: 0px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: start; position: static; opacity: 1\\">2018 год</time>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\"history__text\\" role=\\"article\\" style=\\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(85, 156, 180); background: rgb(85, 156, 180) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 27px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 32.4px; text-align: start; padding: 5px 15px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(255, 255, 255); border-radius: 30px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: block; flex-direction: row; position: relative; opacity: 1\\">В 2018&nbsp;г. продолжается активное строительство новых фитнес-клубов. Fitness House узнают в&nbsp;регионах. Открываются вторые клубы в&nbsp;Казани и&nbsp;Нижнем Новгороде. Теперь наши клубы в&nbsp;Тольятти и&nbsp;Ульяновске.</div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li class=\\"history__item\\" style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 20.8px; text-align: start; padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(0, 0, 0); border-radius: 0px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: block; flex-direction: row; position: static; opacity: 1\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<time datetime=\\"2019\\" class=\\"history__title\\" style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 26px; text-align: start; padding: 0px 0px 16px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(33, 37, 41); border-radius: 0px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: start; position: static; opacity: 1\\">2019 год</time>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\"history__text\\" role=\\"article\\" style=\\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(81, 165, 188); background: rgb(81, 165, 188) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 27px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 32.4px; text-align: start; padding: 5px 15px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(255, 255, 255); border-radius: 30px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: block; flex-direction: row; position: relative; opacity: 1\\">Открываются новые клубы в&nbsp;Архангельске, Ижевске, Самаре, Ярославле и&nbsp;Петрозаводске.</div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li class=\\"history__item\\" style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 20.8px; text-align: start; padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(0, 0, 0); border-radius: 0px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: block; flex-direction: row; position: static; opacity: 1\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<time datetime=\\"2020\\" class=\\"history__title\\" style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 26px; text-align: start; padding: 0px 0px 16px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(33, 37, 41); border-radius: 0px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: start; position: static; opacity: 1\\">2020 год</time>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\"history__text\\" role=\\"article\\" style=\\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(84, 170, 182); background: rgb(84, 170, 182) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 27px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 32.4px; text-align: start; padding: 5px 15px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(255, 255, 255); border-radius: 30px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: block; flex-direction: row; position: relative; opacity: 1\\">Fitness House продолжает покорять регионы. Теперь наши клубы в&nbsp;Рязани, открываются вторые клубы в&nbsp;Самаре и&nbsp;Ижевске.\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tВ Санкт-Петербурге появляются два новых фитнес-клуба Fitness House в ТЦ \\"Охта Молл\\" и на улице Салова.</div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li class=\\"history__item\\" style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 20.8px; text-align: start; padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(0, 0, 0); border-radius: 0px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: block; flex-direction: row; position: static; opacity: 1\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<time datetime=\\"2021\\" class=\\"history__title\\" style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 26px; text-align: start; padding: 0px 0px 16px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(33, 37, 41); border-radius: 0px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: start; position: static; opacity: 1\\">2021 год</time>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\"history__text\\" role=\\"article\\" style=\\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(99, 179, 184); background: rgb(99, 179, 184) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 27px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 32.4px; text-align: start; padding: 5px 15px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(255, 255, 255); border-radius: 30px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: block; flex-direction: row; position: relative; opacity: 1\\">Fitness House активно продолжает свой рост в&nbsp;Санкт-Петербурге, Казани, Самаре, Ижевске. К&nbsp;концу 2021 года сеть насчитывает 66 клубов в&nbsp;12 городах&nbsp;РФ.</div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li class=\\"history__item\\" style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 20.8px; text-align: start; padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(0, 0, 0); border-radius: 0px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: block; flex-direction: row; position: static; opacity: 1\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<time datetime=\\"2022\\" class=\\"history__title\\" style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 26px; text-align: start; padding: 0px 0px 16px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(33, 37, 41); border-radius: 0px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: start; position: static; opacity: 1\\">2022 год</time>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\"history__text\\" role=\\"article\\" style=\\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(109, 189, 194); background: rgb(109, 189, 194) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 27px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 32.4px; text-align: start; padding: 5px 15px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(255, 255, 255); border-radius: 30px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: block; flex-direction: row; position: relative; opacity: 1\\">Открываются 6 новых клубов: 3 в&nbsp;Санкт-Петербурге, а&nbsp;также в&nbsp;других городах: в&nbsp;Набережных Челнах, в&nbsp;Туле и&nbsp;4й&nbsp;клуб в&nbsp;Самаре.</div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li class=\\"history__item\\" style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 20.8px; text-align: start; padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(0, 0, 0); border-radius: 0px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: block; flex-direction: row; position: static; opacity: 1\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<time datetime=\\"2023\\" class=\\"history__title\\" style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 26px; text-align: start; padding: 0px 0px 16px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(33, 37, 41); border-radius: 0px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: start; position: static; opacity: 1\\">2023 год</time>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\"history__text\\" role=\\"article\\" style=\\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(119, 199, 204); background: rgb(119, 199, 204) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 27px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 32.4px; text-align: start; padding: 5px 15px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(255, 255, 255); border-radius: 30px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: block; flex-direction: row; position: relative; opacity: 1\\">Fitness House продолжает расширяться. Открываются вторые клубы в Ярославле и в Архангельске</div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li class=\\"history__item\\" style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 20.8px; text-align: start; padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(0, 0, 0); border-radius: 0px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: block; flex-direction: row; position: static; opacity: 1\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<time datetime=\\"2024\\" class=\\"history__title\\" style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 26px; text-align: start; padding: 0px 0px 16px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(33, 37, 41); border-radius: 0px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: start; position: static; opacity: 1\\">2024 год</time>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\"history__text\\" role=\\"article\\" style=\\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(119, 199, 204); background: rgb(119, 199, 204) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 27px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 32.4px; text-align: start; padding: 5px 15px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(255, 255, 255); border-radius: 30px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: block; flex-direction: row; position: relative; opacity: 1\\">Покоряем новые регионы России! Открыты клубы в Екатеринбурге и Тюмени. А еще 3-й клуб в Ярославле.</div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li class=\\"history__item\\" style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 20.8px; text-align: start; padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(0, 0, 0); border-radius: 0px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: block; flex-direction: row; position: static; opacity: 1\\">\\n                          <time datetime=\\"2025\\" class=\\"history__title\\" style=\\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 26px; text-align: start; padding: 0px 0px 16px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(33, 37, 41); border-radius: 0px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: start; position: static; opacity: 1\\">2025 год</time>\\n                          <div class=\\"history__text\\" role=\\"article\\" style=\\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(119, 199, 204); background: rgb(119, 199, 204) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 27px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 32.4px; text-align: start; padding: 5px 15px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(255, 255, 255); border-radius: 30px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: block; flex-direction: row; position: relative; opacity: 1\\">Фитнес Хаус направил вектор своего р��звития на улучшение действующих клубов. В 54 клубах полностью обновлен дизайн, придающий пространствам современный и динамичный вид. Также были проведены масштабные реновации в клубах на Крестовском, Стачек, Новаторов и в Казани на Спартаковской, что позволило вывести их в премиальный сегмент сети.</div>\\n                        </li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t</ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t</section>\\n\\t\\t\\t</div>\\n\\t\\t</div>\\n\\t</div>\\n</div>\\n<style style=\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) none repeat scroll 0% 0% / auto padding-box border-box; font-family: &quot;Avenir Next Cyr&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 20.8px; text-align: start; padding: 0px 0px 0px 15px; margin: 0px; border: 0px none rgb(0, 0, 0); border-radius: 0px; min-width: 0px; min-height: 0px; display: block; flex-direction: row; position: static; opacity: 1\\">\\n\\t:root {\\n  --bg-banner: white;\\n  --br-banner: 1.38rem;\\n  --bg-btn: #42474d;\\n  --br-btn: 1rem;\\n}\\n.cookie-banner {\\n  position: fixed;\\n  bottom: 0;\\n  left: auto;\\n  right: 0;\\n  box-shadow: -1px 4px 24px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);\\n  background: var(--bg-banner);\\n  border-radius: var(--br-banner);\\n  padding: 1.38rem;\\n  margin: 1rem 0.5rem;\\n  z-index: 1000;\\n  transform: translateY(100%);\\n  transition: transform 0.3s ease-out, opacity 0.3s ease;\\n  opacity: 0;\\n}\\n\\n.cookie-banner.show {\\n  transform: translateY(0);\\n  opacity: 1;\\n}\\n\\n.cookie-content {\\n  display: flex;\\n  align-items: center;\\n  gap: 16px;\\n  max-width: 1200px;\\n  margin: 0 auto;\\n}\\n\\n.cookie-icon {\\n  flex-shrink: 0;\\n  display: flex;\\n  align-items: center;\\n  width: 40px;\\n  heigth: 40px;\\n}\\n\\n.cookie-text {\\n  margin: 0;\\n  flex: 1;\\n  font-weight: 400;\\n  font-size: 0.88rem;\\n  line-height: 129%;\\n  color: #42474d;\\n}\\n\\n.cookie-link {\\n  color: #42474d;\\n  font-weight: 500;\\n  text-decoration: underline;\\n  white-space: nowrap;\\n}\\n\\n.cookie-button {\\n  box-shadow: 0 3px 12px 0 rgba(74, 58, 255, 0.18);\\n  background: var(--bg-btn);\\n  color: white;\\n  border: none;\\n  border-radius: var(--br-btn);\\n  padding: 0.75rem 2.5rem 0.88rem 2.5rem;\\n  cursor: pointer;\\n  font-size: 14px;\\n  font-weight: 500;\\n  transition: background-color 0.2s;\\n  flex-shrink: 0;\\n  min-width: 100px;\\n}\\n\\n.cookie-button:hover {\\n  opacity: 0.5;\\n}\\n\\n@media (max-width: 768px) {